# profiles/Brewfile.minimal - Minimal additions
# For the 'minimal' profile, the base Brewfile already covers essentials.
# This file intentionally contains few extras.
#
# The minimal profile uses the full base Brewfile but skips:
#   - 3D printing tools
#   - Heavy casks (Xcode, OBS, etc.)
#   - Most MAS apps
#
# To further restrict, set MOD_DOCK=false and MOD_MACOS_DEFAULTS=false
# via environment variables or the interactive module toggle menu.

# Nothing additional for minimal — base Brewfile is sufficient.
